---
// Clone flow: Speaker smp-steps ordered pattern.
// Dashboard journey: Registration erg-bento alternating rows with product visuals.
// Related links: Registration erg-use-grid pattern.
// Audiences: Speaker clickup-card pattern (six cards, 3x2).
---

<!-- Selective clone flow: Speaker ordered-steps pattern -->
<section class="cdd-steps">
  <div class="cdd-steps__inner">
    <header class="cdd-steps__header animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <span>Repeatable event setup</span>
      <h2>Start the next edition from a proven event&mdash;without carrying old attendee results</h2>
      <p>Choose a previous event, select what should carry forward, and create the new edition with fresh registration data.</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="cdd-steps__list">
      <li class="animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
        <span class="cdd-steps__num">01</span>
        <div><h3>Choose the source event</h3><p>Start from the edition whose setup worked.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="60">
        <span class="cdd-steps__num">02</span>
        <div><h3>Select what to reuse</h3><p>Choose supported settings, content, resources, and access assignments.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="120">
        <span class="cdd-steps__num">03</span>
        <div><h3>Create the new event</h3><p>Generate the new event as a separate workspace.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="180">
        <span class="cdd-steps__num">04</span>
        <div><h3>Start with fresh registrations</h3><p>Keep the previous event's attendee outcomes out of the new edition.</p></div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Dashboard journey: Registration alternating bento pattern -->
<section class="cdd-bento">
  <div class="cdd-bento-container">
    <div class="cdd-bento-header animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <span class="cdd-bento-kicker">How the dashboard works</span>
      <h2>Use the portfolio for control and each event workspace for execution</h2>
      <p>The dashboard shortens the path from seeing a signal to acting on the correct event.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cdd-bento-grid animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <span class="cdd-bento-notch cdd-bento-notch--top" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb"></path></svg></span>
      <span class="cdd-bento-notch cdd-bento-notch--bottom" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="scale(1,-1)"></path></svg></span>
      <div class="cdd-bento-row">
        <div class="cdd-bento-cell cdd-bento-visual">
          <div class="cdd-bento-shot-stage cdd-bento-shot-stage--brand">
            <img class="cdd-bento-product-shot" src="/feature-images/centralized-dashboard/brand-surface-visual.svg" alt="EventHex organization brand and account settings" width="773" height="573" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="cdd-shot-float cdd-shot-float--top"><b>Shared</b><small>Organization context</small></span>
            <span class="cdd-shot-float cdd-shot-float--bottom"><i></i><b>Brand saved</b></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cdd-bento-cell cdd-bento-content">
          <span class="cdd-bento-eyebrow">Shared</span>
          <h3>Set organization context</h3>
          <p>Configure shared account, terminology, brand, plan, and access settings.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="cdd-bento-cross" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="scale(1,-1)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(90)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(-90)"></path></svg></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cdd-bento-row cdd-bento-row--reverse">
        <div class="cdd-bento-cell cdd-bento-content">
          <span class="cdd-bento-eyebrow">Repeatable</span>
          <h3>Create or clone events</h3>
          <p>Build a new event or reuse selected setup from a proven edition.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cdd-bento-cell cdd-bento-visual">
          <div class="cdd-bento-shot-stage cdd-bento-shot-stage--setup">
            <img class="cdd-bento-product-shot" src="/feature-images/centralized-dashboard/event-setup-visual.svg" alt="EventHex event setup and selective cloning" width="773" height="573" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="cdd-shot-float cdd-shot-float--top"><b>Selective clone</b><small>Setup carried forward</small></span>
            <span class="cdd-shot-float cdd-shot-float--bottom"><i></i><b>New edition</b></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="cdd-bento-cross" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="scale(1,-1)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(90)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(-90)"></path></svg></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cdd-bento-row">
        <div class="cdd-bento-cell cdd-bento-visual">
          <div class="cdd-bento-shot-stage cdd-bento-shot-stage--signal">
            <img class="cdd-bento-product-shot" src="/feature-images/centralized-dashboard/event-portfolio-visual.svg" alt="EventHex portfolio dashboard with event metrics" width="773" height="573" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="cdd-shot-float cdd-shot-float--top"><b>Visible</b><small>Portfolio signal</small></span>
            <span class="cdd-shot-float cdd-shot-float--bottom"><i></i><b>Needs attention</b></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cdd-bento-cell cdd-bento-content">
          <span class="cdd-bento-eyebrow">Visible</span>
          <h3>Monitor the portfolio</h3>
          <p>Review attention signals, people insight, and comparable event measures.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="cdd-bento-cross" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="scale(1,-1)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(90)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(-90)"></path></svg></span>
      </div>
      <div class="cdd-bento-row cdd-bento-row--reverse">
        <div class="cdd-bento-cell cdd-bento-content">
          <span class="cdd-bento-eyebrow">Direct</span>
          <h3>Open the event</h3>
          <p>Move into the event workspace for detailed operational work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cdd-bento-cell cdd-bento-visual">
          <div class="cdd-bento-shot-stage cdd-bento-shot-stage--access">
            <img class="cdd-bento-product-shot" src="/feature-images/centralized-dashboard/role-access-visual.svg" alt="EventHex event-level team access" width="773" height="573" loading="lazy" />
            <span class="cdd-shot-float cdd-shot-float--top"><b>Scoped access</b><small>Event workspace</small></span>
            <span class="cdd-shot-float cdd-shot-float--bottom"><i></i><b>Team in place</b></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="cdd-bento-cross" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="scale(1,-1)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(90)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(-90)"></path></svg></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Adjacent feature links: Registration use-case grid pattern -->
<section class="cdd-use">
  <div class="cdd-use-shell">
    <div class="cdd-use-heading animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <span class="cdd-use-kicker">Open the right event workflow</span>
      <h2 class="cdd-use-title">Continue into the <span>feature</span> that owns the detail</h2>
      <p class="cdd-use-sub">The centralized dashboard routes teams to the event-level capability they need next.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cdd-use-grid">
      <div class="cdd-use-notch cdd-use-notch--1" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e2e8f2"></path></svg></div>
      <div class="cdd-use-notch cdd-use-notch--2" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e2e8f2"></path></svg></div>
      <div class="cdd-use-notch cdd-use-notch--3" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#e2e8f2"></path></svg></div>
      <a href="/event-analytics/" class="cdd-use-card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
        <div class="cdd-use-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg></div>
        <h3>Event Analytics</h3><p>Review deeper event-level performance and reporting.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/event-registration/" class="cdd-use-card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="60">
        <div class="cdd-use-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 21v-9h16v9M7 12V5h10v7M9 8h2m2 0h2M8 16h2m4 0h2"></path></svg></div>
        <h3>Event Registration</h3><p>Manage the form or checkout journey for one event.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/event-check-in/" class="cdd-use-card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="120">
        <div class="cdd-use-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect></svg></div>
        <h3>Event Check-In</h3><p>Run QR arrival and live attendance operations.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/white-label/" class="cdd-use-card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="180">
        <div class="cdd-use-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5"></circle><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.93 0 1.65-.75 1.65-1.69 0-.44-.18-.84-.44-1.13-.26-.29-.43-.68-.43-1.12A1.68 1.68 0 0 1 14.46 16h2.08A2.46 2.46 0 0 0 19 13.54c0-.09-.01-.18-.02-.27C18.34 7.28 15.54 2 12 2z"></path></svg></div>
        <h3>White-Label Platform</h3><p>Set up branded organization workspaces and platform oversight.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Buyer audiences: Speaker clickup-card pattern, six cards -->
<section class="cdd-aud">
  <div class="cdd-aud__inner">
    <header class="cdd-steps__header cdd-steps__header--center animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <span>Built for multi-event teams</span>
      <h2>Use one portfolio view across the programmes your organization runs</h2>
      <p>Keep each event independent while the organization sees the full calendar.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="cdd-aud__grid">
      <article class="cdd-aud__card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp"><h3>Event agencies</h3><p>Move between client or programme events with clear workspace boundaries.</p></article>
      <article class="cdd-aud__card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="60"><h3>Associations</h3><p>Operate chapter, member, and annual event portfolios.</p></article>
      <article class="cdd-aud__card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="120"><h3>Exhibition organizers</h3><p>Compare show editions and supporting programme events.</p></article>
      <article class="cdd-aud__card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="180"><h3>Corporate teams</h3><p>Coordinate internal, customer, and partner events.</p></article>
      <article class="cdd-aud__card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="240"><h3>Conference portfolios</h3><p>Reuse structures across annual or regional conferences.</p></article>
      <article class="cdd-aud__card animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="300"><h3>Tech event teams</h3><p>Track launches, meetups, summits, and recurring community events.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Ordered steps: copied from smp-steps, renamed cdd-steps. */
  .cdd-steps { padding: clamp(64px, 7vw, 96px) 24px; background: #fff; }
  .cdd-steps__inner { width: min(880px, 100%); margin: 0 auto; }
  .cdd-steps__header { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 48px; }
  .cdd-steps__header--center { text-align: center; }
  .cdd-steps__header > span { display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #375dfb; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: 0.13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cdd-steps__header h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 52px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #111827; }
  .cdd-steps__header p { margin: 0; color: #596579; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .cdd-steps__list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid #dfe5ee; }
  .cdd-steps__list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 25px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe5ee; }
  .cdd-steps__num { color: #375dfb; font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 750; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; line-height: 1.7; }
  .cdd-steps__list h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; color: #111827; }
  .cdd-steps__list p { margin: 0; color: #596579; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
  /* Bento rows: copied from erg-bento-section, renamed cdd-bento. */
  .cdd-bento { padding: 80px 5%; background: #fff; }
  .cdd-bento-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cdd-bento-header { text-align: center; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 60px; }
  .cdd-bento-kicker { display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #375dfb; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: 0.13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cdd-bento-header h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.08; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #111827; }
  .cdd-bento-header p { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #596579; }
  .cdd-bento-grid { position: relative; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: transparent; }
  .cdd-bento-notch { position: absolute; left: 50%; width: 28px; height: 28px; pointer-events: none; line-height: 0; z-index: 2; }
  .cdd-bento-notch--top { top: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); }
  .cdd-bento-notch--bottom { bottom: 0; transform: translate(-50%, 50%); }
  .cdd-bento-row { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  .cdd-bento-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .cdd-bento-cell { padding: 4rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
  .cdd-bento-row .cdd-bento-cell:first-child { border-right: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  .cdd-bento-visual { align-items: center; }
  .cdd-bento-shot-stage { position: relative; width: 100%; padding: 32px 18px; border-radius: 22px; isolation: isolate; }
  .cdd-bento-shot-stage--brand { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #dbe1fb 0%, #eceffd 45%, #f5f6f9 100%); }
  .cdd-bento-shot-stage--setup { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #cdf3de 0%, #e6f8ee 45%, #f5f6f9 100%); }
  .cdd-bento-shot-stage--signal { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fdefb8 0%, #fdf7dd 45%, #f5f6f9 100%); }
  .cdd-bento-shot-stage--access { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fbdde4 0%, #fdecf0 45%, #f5f6f9 100%); }
  .cdd-bento-cross { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 50%; width: 28px; height: 28px; transform: translate(-50%, 50%); pointer-events: none; line-height: 0; z-index: 2; }
  .cdd-bento-row:last-child .cdd-bento-cross { display: none; }
  .cdd-bento-product-shot { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid #dfe4ec; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; animation: cdd-shot-breathe 7s ease-in-out infinite; will-change: transform; }
  .cdd-bento-row:nth-child(even) .cdd-bento-product-shot { animation-delay: -3.5s; }
  .cdd-shot-float { position: absolute; z-index: 2; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; padding: 11px 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(206, 215, 232, 0.9); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96); color: #111827; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(30, 45, 88, 0.2); font-family: var(--font-body); line-height: 1.15; animation: cdd-shot-float 4.8s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .cdd-shot-float b { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cdd-shot-float small { display: block; color: #7b8497; font-size: 0.65rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cdd-shot-float i { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #19b874; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(25, 184, 116, 0.13); }
  .cdd-shot-float--top { top: 12px; right: 3px; }
  .cdd-shot-float--bottom { bottom: 12px; left: 3px; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 9px; animation-delay: -2.4s; }
  @keyframes cdd-shot-breathe { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(3px) scale(0.985); } 50% { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1); } }
  @keyframes cdd-shot-float { 0%, 100% { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0); } 50% { transform: translate3d(0, -9px, 0); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .cdd-bento-product-shot, .cdd-shot-float { animation: none; } }
  .cdd-bento-eyebrow { color: #5b21b6; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block; }
  .cdd-bento-content h3 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #111827; }
  .cdd-bento-content p { font-size: 1.125rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-body); }
  /* Use-case grid: copied from erg-use-cases / erg-use-grid, renamed cdd-use. */
  .cdd-use { padding: clamp(90px, 10vw, 140px) 24px clamp(82px, 9vw, 116px); background: radial-gradient(circle at 8% 25%, rgba(232, 237, 255, 0.8), transparent 42%), radial-gradient(circle at 94% 72%, rgba(245, 238, 255, 0.75), transparent 44%), #fff; }
  .cdd-use-shell { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cdd-use-heading { max-width: none; margin: 0 auto 64px; text-align: center; }
  .cdd-use-kicker { display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #375dfb; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: 0.13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cdd-use-title { max-width: none; margin: 0 auto 12px; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.1; background: linear-gradient(98deg, #182132 43%, #8f8f8f 92%); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; color: transparent; }
  .cdd-use-sub { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 17px; color: #596579; }
  .cdd-use-grid { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f2; border-bottom: 0; }
  .cdd-use-card { position: relative; display: block; min-height: 326px; padding: 30px 28px; border: 0; border-left: 1px solid #e2e8f2; text-decoration: none; }
  .cdd-use-card:first-of-type { border-left: none; }
  .cdd-use-notch { position: absolute; top: 0; width: 28px; height: 28px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); pointer-events: none; line-height: 0; z-index: 2; }
  .cdd-use-notch--1 { left: 25%; } .cdd-use-notch--2 { left: 50%; } .cdd-use-notch--3 { left: 75%; }
